OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirl's war poem displayed on
OL,4,Amemorial stone
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn award-winning war poem written by a
OL,7,FSouth Yorkshire schoolgirl has been
OL,8,Fetched permanently on a memorial stone
OL,9,Fin a city centre park.
OL,11,FMolly Meleady-Hanley, now 23, wrote Me
OL,12,FBrother Dan in 2016 when she was 11, to
OL,13,Fmark the 100th anniversary of the
OL,14,FBattle of the Somme.
OL,16,FThe poem went on to receive
OL,17,Finternational plaudits and feature in
OL,18,Fremembrance events. In 2018, it placed
OL,19,Ffirst in a competition hosted by Never
OL,20,FSuch Innocence, a charity for young
OL,21,Fpeople to speak about conflict through
OL,22,Fcreative arts.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
