OL,3,GNEWSASchoolgirl's war poem displayed on
OL,4,Amemorial stone
OL,5,
OL,6,FLater today, Armed Forces
OL,7,Frepresentatives, veterans, and other
OL,8,Fcivic figures, including Lord Mayor of
OL,9,FSheffield councillor Andrew Sangar,
OL,10,Fwill attend the memorial's unveiling in
OL,11,FWeston Park.
